sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Creator as Creator / Founder
    participant FE as Next.js Creator UI (src/app/dashboard/creator)
    participant AC as Auth & Identity (api/auth)
    participant CC as CreatorIdeasController (api/creator/ideas)
    participant AI as AI Controllers (clarifier, market-study, etc.)
    participant HF as Hangfire Server (ai queue)
    participant LLM as OpenRouter (google/gemini-3.8-flash)
    participant DB as MongoDB (CreatorIdeas, AI Sessions)

    Creator->>FE: 1. Submit Business Idea
    FE->>CC: POST /api/creator/ideas
    CC->>DB: Save CreatorIdea (Project metadata)
    DB-->>CC: Idea Created (businessIdeaId)
    CC-->>FE: Return Idea Object

    Creator->>FE: 2. Start Idea Clarification
    FE->>AI: POST /api/ai/clarifier { businessIdeaId }
    AI->>DB: Check & Debit AI Credits (20 credits)
    AI->>DB: Create ClarifierSession (Pending)
    AI->>HF: Enqueue AiJobType.IdeaClarifier
    AI-->>FE: Return sessionId & jobId

    HF->>DB: Load Canonical Idea Core
    HF->>LLM: Complete structured clarification prompt
    LLM-->>HF: Return clarified problem/solution JSON
    HF->>DB: Save ClarifierSession.Output & update CreatorIdea
    HF-->>FE: Realtime Notification (Clarification Complete)

    Creator->>FE: 3. Generate Project Intelligence (P3 Pipeline)
    Note over FE,DB: Executes MarketStudy -> BusinessModel -> BusinessPlan -> Forecast
    FE->>AI: POST /api/ai/market-study
    AI->>HF: Enqueue MarketStudy (20 credits) -> LLM -> Save MarketStudySession
    FE->>AI: POST /api/ai/business-model
    AI->>HF: Enqueue BusinessModel (18 credits) -> LLM -> Save BusinessModelSession
    FE->>AI: POST /api/ai/business-plan
    AI->>HF: Enqueue BusinessPlan (33 credits) -> LLM -> Save BusinessPlanSession
    FE->>AI: POST /api/ai/forecast
    AI->>HF: Enqueue Forecast (32 credits) -> LLM -> Save ForecastSession

    Creator->>FE: 4. Brand Visual Identity Studio (Phase 2)
    FE->>CC: POST /api/creator/brand-kit/generate
    CC->>DB: Save BrandKit (Logos, Color harmonies, Typography)
    CC-->>FE: Return Rendered SVG Brand Assets

    Creator->>FE: 5. Transition to Marketplace / Deals
    FE->>CC: POST /api/creator/crossroads/publish
    CC->>DB: Update CreatorJourney.Status = Published
